From 8d23982f8080898f24ec3ce682bb3c6f0f1e3f2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: evilcomputer12 <martinrobotika@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 23:55:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] xodus-service: Handle TokenAndSignatureRequest.

Resolve the relying party and signature policy for the URL (endpoint table
fetched once per process), keep one title-bound session per MSA app id +
title id and an XSTS token per relying party in state shared by all
connections, and answer with the XBL3.0 Authorization value, the request
signature and the token expiry. Without ClientId/TitleId the service falls
back to an unsigned user-only XSTS token. Failures are reported as GDK style
HRESULTs: E_GAMEUSER_SIGNED_OUT when nobody is signed in,
E_GAMEUSER_RESOLVE_USER_ISSUE_REQUIRED when Xbox Live refuses the sign-in,
E_INVALIDARG for malformed requests, E_FAIL otherwise.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
